=== meta ===
bypass: 112
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: `workflow: rules:` that only say `when: never` keep every pipeline from running
origin: issue #214, D-113 reading — the ruling's `when: never`, written for the whole pipeline.
=== before: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - lint
  - test

lint:
  stage: lint
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install ruff
    - ruff check .

test:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest
=== after: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
workflow:
  rules:
    - when: never

stages:
  - lint
  - test

lint:
  stage: lint
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install ruff
    - ruff check .

test:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "high", "escalators": ["CI_TEST_COMMAND_WEAKENED"]}]
